#   (30 days), open campaigns with percent (learning-data 86 %), allocation {awaiting 3, overdue30 0, oldestAwaiting}, alerts
#   allocation.overdue 0 · outbox.dead 0 · integrity.failed 0 (the embedded db/reference/003 checks)
# #117 (finance) sales · vat · gifts · zakat · allocation · refunds (empty until the payment service) · shipments, JSON {name, from,
#   to, rows}; gifts total 11125.00 = Σ paid gift lines in SQL; ?format=csv → text/csv, attachment gifts-2026-09-01-2026-09-30.csv,
#   UTF-8 BOM, snake_case header, Arabic intact · unknown report 404 · range > 366 days 400 · viewer 403
# #129 ?mobile=0551110801 → 1 row (full mobile, status, ordersCount) · ?email= (citext, case-insensitive; capped at 20) · neither → 400
# #130 Customer360: row, orders, giving totals (2350.00, 5 units, 1 pooled, 1 dedication), enrolments
# #131 block: viewer 403 · no reason 400 · finance → blocked, refresh tokens revoked, audit customer.block {reason}; OTP verify →
#   403 auth.account_blocked (RUL-61) · #132 unblock → active
# #133 (staff:admin) ?action=customer.block → the entry with its diff object · ?entity=beneficiary → masked diffs · finance 403
@base = http://localhost:5080/v1/admin

### #53 Dashboard
GET {{base}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{viewer}}

### #117 Report (json | csv)
GET {{base}}/reports/gifts?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30&format=csv
Authorization: Bearer {{finance}}

### #129 Customer lookup
GET {{base}}/customers?mobile=0551110801
Authorization: Bearer {{viewer}}

### #130 Customer 360
GET {{base}}/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{viewer}}

### #131 Block
POST {{base}}/customers/{{customerId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{finance}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"احتيال مشتبه"}

### #132 Unblock
POST {{base}}/customers/{{customerId}}/unblock
Authorization: Bearer {{finance}}

### #133 Audit
GET {{base}}/audit?entity=beneficiary&from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
